<title>USA: Ambassador buys Florida apartments.</title>
<headline>Ambassador buys Florida apartments.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambassador Apartments Inc said Monday it purchased two garden-apartment properties containing 683 units in Tampa., Fla., for a total of $15 million.</p>
<p>The price included closing costs.</p>
<p>The company said it intended to finance a portion of the acquisition of the property with tax-exempt bonds.</p>
<p>Prior to the purchase, Ambassador said, it received two new inducement resolutions from the Florida Housing Finance Authority for a total of $11.9 million  of tax exempt bonds which will be secured by first mortgages on the properties.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
